  "decision": "NX-032 A2 (docs/implementation/NX-032-stage-publish-design.md §2.2, owner-approved 2026-10-15): the frozen capability snapshots the stage publication binds Actions and Functions to. schema_hash is computed by nexloop_eios.catalog_manifests from the contract (never written by hand); a snapshot is immutable once published, so a contract change is a new capability_version and a new Action version. Governed capabilities must be registered in control.nexloop_governed_capabilities by a migration, and their contract names the registered operation. Version 1 holds the capabilities of business-actions.v1.json, the six workbench goal capabilities, and the system Actions and Functions of system-actions.v1.json (T1 list). Function snapshots are side-effect free (conversation_effect_receipts and conversation_scope_denials require it); read-only Actions say why they are side-effecting.",
